		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Elixir H</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A potent healing draught.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Restore: 2d4+4 HP.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Restore: 3d6+6 HP.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You regain +INT HP when drinking healing potions or Elixir H's.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Restores 3d6+6 HP, plus your INT from the passive.</em></p><p><em>[M] Thrown to an ally with Shared Elixirs, subtract your INT.</em></p>",
